	(text "Some MicroSD modules don't\nhave logic level converters\nbuilt in. SD & MicroSD cards\nare 3.3v devices! Ensure to\nuse a module with a logic\nlevel converter!"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 158.75 187.96 0)
		(effects
